  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "AlCoCrFeNi2.1 is an eutectic high-entropy alloy suitable as the example system.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast alloy has a lamellar microstructure inherited from solidification.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The lamellar microstructure combines a soft FCC phase with a hard BCC or intermetallic phase.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514768::web::022::4_3_designing_rules_for_eheas"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 70% cold-rolling reduction is an appropriate deformation step for the proposed intervention.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A sub-recrystallization or intermediate-temperature anneal after cold rolling is an appropriate heat treatment.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tailored thermomechanical processing can create an ultrafine-grained, hierarchically heterogeneous duplex microstructure while retaining the cast lamellar character of AlCoCrFeNi2.1.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lamellar refinement increases the density of interphase boundaries.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined interphase boundaries promote dislocation storage.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hierarchical microstructure produces a two-hierarchical constraint effect.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed microstructure produces a self-generated microcrack-arresting mechanism.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hierarchical constraint and crack-arrest mechanisms mitigate strain localization.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain boundaries and phase constraints increase strength by impeding dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Improved strain partitioning delays failure and increases ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermomechanical processing will simultaneously increase yield strength and ductility relative to the as-cast baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Both yield strength and ductility may improve by on the order of tens of percent.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined lamellar architecture remains stable during room-temperature quasi-static tensile loading.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed effect should extend to eutectic HEAs generally when they inherit a lamellar composite microstructure.",
